# Vestigial: no Artie build uses the repository root as its Docker build context any
# more. Each component's tasks build from their own directory and stage anything they
# need from another component via 'dependency-files' (see the fw-eyebrows and fw-mouth
# tasks). This file only matters if you run `docker build` at the root by hand.
.git
.continue
.vscode
build-artifacts
test-results
tmp
telemetry-example
rpyc-examples
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/artie-tool*.txt
**/testlog-*.txt
artie-common/firmware/*/src/build
